ISC License

  Twenty-eight icons are vendored as inline <symbol> elements in
  desktop/ui/index.html: activity, arrow-left, arrow-right-left, check,
  chevron-right, circle-alert, circle-x, copy, ellipsis, folder, folder-plus,
  git-branch, key-round, layout-dashboard, loader-circle, monitor-cog, play,
  plus, refresh-cw, search, settings, shield-check, square, star, terminal,
  trash-2, users-round, and x.

  They are vendored rather than fetched because the application has no build
  step and its content security policy (`default-src 'self'`) forbids loading
  assets from any other origin.

